			"notes": "# Airship hub — tested preview\nExact binary from successful client run https://github.com/Antoniumu/Age-of-Epoch/actions/runs/40591863608 (source 34095a2).\nMinecraft 26.3, Fabric Loader 0.19.5, Java 25. Install on both client and server with Fabric API and Trinkets Updated as required by the mod.\nUse /airship summon (8 emeralds), or /airship demo as an operator. Enter the light circle below the ship. Right-click the captain to accept the introductory quest. H shows the quest giver card. /airship descend returns below the ship.\nBuild and 36 tests passed; real client verified ship, lift, dialogue, acceptance click, H card, and the full introductory chain.\nThis is a preview, not a finished questbook replacement. Crew are currently villager placeholders. Player skins, the Winged Sailor build, trade and voice playback are NOT included. Existing ship blocks are not protected against griefing; no claim integration. Back up your world. Restart persistence was not separately tested.\nInternal mod version remains 5.1.0; the preview filename/tag distinguishes this artifact from the older 5.1.0 release. Not marked as latest stable release."
		},
